"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"漫画は〜ｽｲｯﾁｶﾞｰﾙかな。\n少女漫画なんだけど\n知ってますか?あとﾀｲﾄﾙ\n忘れちゃったけど 女の子も\n男の子も両方 椿っていう\n名前のやつ。めちゃくちゃ\nきゅんきゅん(´･ω･`)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"する"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ｱﾆﾒはーんー最近見ないな〜"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/cloud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"んー分かりません。\nごめんなさい"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/sad.gif","alt":""},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.どんなｲﾍﾞﾝﾄやりたい?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.乃木坂を5ｸﾞﾙｰﾌﾟぐらい\nに分けてﾌｧﾝの方々も\n抽選で振り分けて大縄\nやりたいです(;o;)"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/heart02.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"勝ったｸﾞﾙｰﾌﾟから\n一緒にご飯食べれるみたいな?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"うんうん、楽しそう"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github.io/n46-crawler/mb/yuuri.saito/img/blog/photos/icon/bud.gif","alt":""},{"type":"paragraph","text":"ﾜｲ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"Q.好きな動物･飼いたい動物は?"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"paragraph","text":"A.好きな動物はやっぱり\nﾜﾝちゃんかな〜あと\n絵に書いたようなｸﾏ"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"break"},{"type":"image","src":"https://janelin612.github